<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait's Burgan Bank raises '96, '95 net.</title>
<headline>Kuwait's Burgan Bank raises '96, '95 net.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			  (Million of dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996			 1995</p>
<p> Net profit		    11.04			 8.05</p>
<p> Interest income	     52.25			53.71</p>
<p> Net interest income	 10.34			 8.36</p>
<p> Total sssets		965.790		    948.028</p>
<p> Government debt bonds   288.41		     310.814</p>
<p>Full name: Burgan Bank S.A.K.</p>
<p>Note - The figures were published in paid advertisements in local newspapers following a general assembly meeting. Earlier figures announced by the Kuwait Stock Exchange as presented by the bank had put net profits for 1996 and 1995 at 10.542 million dinars and 7.686 million dinars respectively.</p>
<p>- Ashraf Fouad, +965 240 8945</p>
</text>
